From 45a2ac3f4bfc71d8400f8a4f4eb99941009021b6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BlackF1re <55582873+BlackF1re@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 00:05:29 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] cpu: consolidate final Hikari subsystem support

Repackage the prepared CPU/DVFS source and retain the validated operating
points. Also expose the MMIO-only Sony-style power-collapse clock transition
used by Hikari system suspend: CPU/L2 switch to AFAB without changing voltage
or interconnect votes, then restore their saved SCPLL rates after wake.

Prepared-source-tree: e3d73fd2f7bffefd6e42b0ec789d4e0af81fde45
Original-author: BlackF1re <plevickij57@gmail.com>
Original-series: research/patches/pre-subsystem-series-20261005
Signed-off-by: BlackF1re <55582873+BlackF1re@users.noreply.github.com>
